        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "The loops and tapes within the skirt are a simple but effective way of adapting a skirt to a bustle. The fit suggests that this outfit belonged to an old lady. The unshaped bodice is unusual."@en ;
